/// <summary>The **<c>CustomElementRegistry</c>** interface provides methods for registering custom elements and querying registered elements. To get an instance of it, use the window.customElements property. To create a scoped registry, use the CustomElementRegistry() constructor. [MDN Reference](https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/API/CustomElementRegistry)</summary>
