    /// <summary>The **<c>HTMLTableElement.deleteRow()</c>** method removes a specific row (&lt;tr&gt;) from a given &lt;table&gt;. [MDN Reference](https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/API/HTMLTableElement/deleteRow)</summary>
