/// <summary>The **<c>PannerNode</c>** interface defines an audio-processing object that represents the location, direction, and behavior of an audio source signal in a simulated physical space. This AudioNode uses right-hand Cartesian coordinates to describe the source's position as a vector and its orientation as a 3D directional cone. [MDN Reference](https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/API/PannerNode)</summary>
